Build and end to end Promotion effectiveness application using datasets in data/.

Context:

1> promotion.csv - contains promotion/SKU spend information
2> sales.csv contains 2 months of sales data
3> These two datasets have no common key; product/SKU names may differ

Build:

1> Entity resolution - match promotion SKU to sales product using normalisation, fuzzy/semantic matching and confidence scores
2> Promotion analysis - Calculate baseline sales, promotion period sales, lift % incremental units/revenue and ROI using deterministic python calculations.
3>Hybrid RAG - combine structured retrieval/calculations with vector retriever for business context.
4> Claude powered Q&A - answer category questions such as “How much did this promotion helps” with citations and evidences
5> LLM-as-a-judge - evaluate answers for correctness, relevance, roundedness, completeness and unsupported claims
6> Evaluation - add deterministic metric validation, and a small golden evaluation dataset.
7> Streamlit UI - provide data overview, promotion analysis, Q&A, retrieved evidence and evaluation results.

Use clean modular architecture, tests, logging, .env configuration and README

Important: Do not let LLM perform core numerical calculations, Clearly distinguishes correlation from assumptions and causations

First inspect the dataset, propose the architecture briefly, the implement and test the application only when architecture is approved
